## Transactions and journals

- [IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/tp): computer vision, pattern recognition, and machine learning
- [IEEE Transactions on Computers](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/tc): computer architecture, hardware design, and systems
- [IEEE Transactions on Software Engineering](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/ts): software design, construction, testing, and maintenance
- [IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/tk): databases, data mining, and knowledge representation
- [IEEE Transactions on Parallel and Distributed Systems](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/td): parallel algorithms, distributed systems, and high-performance computing
- [IEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/tg): visualization, graphics, virtual and augmented reality
- [IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/tm): mobile and wireless systems, protocols, and applications
- [IEEE Transactions on Dependable and Secure Computing](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/tq): reliability, fault tolerance, security, and privacy
- [IEEE Transactions on Cloud Computing](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/cc): cloud architecture, virtualization, and services
- [IEEE Transactions on Services Computing](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/sc): service-oriented architecture, web services, and business process integration
- [IEEE Transactions on Big Data](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/bd): large-scale data management, analytics, and infrastructure
- [IEEE Transactions on Affective Computing](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/ta): emotion recognition, sentiment analysis, and human-computer affect
- [IEEE Transactions on Emerging Topics in Computing](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/ec): new and cross-disciplinary areas of computing
- [IEEE Transactions on Sustainable Computing](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/su): energy-efficient and environmentally sustainable computing
- [IEEE Transactions on Privacy](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/pr): privacy-enhancing technologies, policy, and practice
- [IEEE/ACM Transactions on Computational Biology and Bioinformatics](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/bb): computational methods in biology, genomics, and medicine
- [IEEE Computer Architecture Letters](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/ca): short, rapid-turnaround papers on computer architecture
- [IEEE Open Journal of the Computer Society](https://www.computer.org/csdl/journal/oj): fully open access journal spanning the Society's technical scope

